  "description": "PIBXUW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C216 H304 Co4 Dy4 N8 O30,0.5(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.246-4.967 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.47-176.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links.",
